{"unit_id":"XSJUSTC__dsh-rewind#card-zh","repo":"XSJUSTC/dsh-rewind","commit":"bff8664a5b6165122b75af253a350b36b77533ce","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@xsj/dsh-rewind 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话回退插件，由宿主端和浏览器端组成。它在用户消息旁提供回退入口，点击后可打断正在运行的回合、将消息内容和图片放回输入框，并在下一次发送前暂时隐藏该消息之后的聊天内容。发送后，插件把回退区间应用到模型上下文，同时保留原始会话日志；等待期间也可取消并恢复隐藏内容。适合需要修正提问、重新组织上下文后继续会话的 DSH Web 用户。安装到 web profile 并重启 DSH；不需要额外 API 密钥或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:270-299","lib/index.js:392-409","lib/client.js:461-479","lib/client.js:576-583"]}
{"unit_id":"XSJUSTC__dsh-rewind#card-en","repo":"XSJUSTC/dsh-rewind","commit":"bff8664a5b6165122b75af253a350b36b77533ce","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@xsj/dsh-rewind adds a rewind action to DSH Web messages. It interrupts a running turn, restores text and images to the composer, and hides later chat rows. Sending commits the rewind so the model no longer sees that tail; cancel restores it. Install in the web profile and restart DSH.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:270-299","lib/index.js:392-409","lib/client.js:461-479","lib/client.js:576-583"]}
