{"unit_id":"XSJUSTC__dsh-rewind#feature-3","repo":"XSJUSTC/dsh-rewind","commit":"bff8664a5b6165122b75af253a350b36b77533ce","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@xsj/dsh-rewind 的功能「回退用户消息」：在每条用户消息旁显示回退按钮。点击后将原文放入可编辑草稿，并标记该消息及其后续内容；如果代理正在运行，也会立即请求中断当前回合。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:461-472","lib/index.js:270-299"]}
{"unit_id":"XSJUSTC__dsh-rewind#feature-4","repo":"XSJUSTC/dsh-rewind","commit":"bff8664a5b6165122b75af253a350b36b77533ce","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@xsj/dsh-rewind 的功能「提交隐藏区间」：回退待发送时先隐藏目标消息之后的聊天行；下一条真实输入进入步骤时，将区间提交并从模型派生消息中滤除。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:264-328","lib/index.js:392-415"]}
{"unit_id":"XSJUSTC__dsh-rewind#feature-5","repo":"XSJUSTC/dsh-rewind","commit":"bff8664a5b6165122b75af253a350b36b77533ce","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@xsj/dsh-rewind 的功能「取消回退」：等待发送期间显示取消按钮。点击后清除待回退状态、恢复隐藏的聊天行，草稿仍留在输入框且不会自动发送。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:302-317","lib/client.js:576-583"]}
{"unit_id":"XSJUSTC__dsh-rewind#feature-6","repo":"XSJUSTC/dsh-rewind","commit":"bff8664a5b6165122b75af253a350b36b77533ce","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@xsj/dsh-rewind 的功能「回填图片」：回退含图片的用户消息时，宿主从会话日志读取被引用附件字节，客户端构造文件并通过 composer 的文件输入重新入档。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:333-370","lib/client.js:63-105","lib/client.js:473-479"]}
{"unit_id":"XSJUSTC__dsh-rewind#feature-7","repo":"XSJUSTC/dsh-rewind","commit":"bff8664a5b6165122b75af253a350b36b77533ce","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@xsj/dsh-rewind 的功能「重启后恢复」：宿主扫描追加式会话事件，重建已提交的隐藏区间；客户端读取状态后重新应用聊天行隐藏效果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:237-263","lib/client.js:330-339"]}
